  "created": "2026-11-23T08:54:09.29Z",
  "description": "An update to Component factory's krypton toolkit to support .NET Framework 4.7.2 - 4.8.1 and .NET 10 - 12. Krypton Workspace for WinForms: customisable multi-cell document area with drag-and-drop page layout. Each cell hosts a Krypton Navigator so pages can be split, tabbed, and rearranged by the user. This package supports all .NET Framework versions starting .NET Framework 4.6.2 - 4.8.1 and .NET 10 - 12. Also, all libraries are included targeting each specific framework version for performance purposes. To view all of the standard toolkit package latest version information, please visit: https://github.com/Krypton-Suite/Krypton-Toolkit-Suite-Version-Dashboard/blob/main/Documents/Modules/Standard/Krypton-Toolkit-Suite-Standard-Modules.md",
  "iconFile": "Krypton Stable.png",
